                <zone h='2500' id='19' name='Total Attempts, Carts and Orders' param='[federated.0co6c0j1cl8wdw1bgay1w1xuy5v7].[none:Attempt Date (copy)_6136928573982511104:qk]' show-domain='false' show-null-ctrls='false' type-v2='filter' w='49407' x='593' y='3857'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='11286' id='18' is-fixed='true' name='Total Attempts, Carts and Orders' w='49333' x='50000' y='9250'>
                  <layout-cache fixed-size-h='308' minwidth='302' type-h='fixed' type-w='scalable' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='237' forceUpdate='true' h='8750' id='27' type-v2='text' w='98814' x='593' y='28858'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>Additional Events Consumed by Anti-Fraud: Payment Updates &amp; Order Status Updates</run>
                    <run>

Aside from the payload received in the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7'>scoring attempt</run>
                    <run>, our Anti Fraud System also consumes information from 3 other additional topics, Payment Updates, Order Status updates and Customer Event stream. These topics are then available to be used for the creation of metrics.

All transaction attempts have at least one </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7'>scoring attempt</run>
                    <run>, which comes from the payment-score topic. This is the information we receive when having to score a transaction, with its respective Data Layer Enrichments (metrics, data transformations, etc).

Most </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759'>CARTS</run>
                    <run> (which can encompass </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7'>several attempts</run>
                    <run>) have at least one Payment update, coming from the payment-updates topic, which gives us the PSP response to the payment processing. Some carts will receive more than one update, and some none. As of December 2023, Hungerstation and PedidosYa do not send payment updates to the system. 

We would expect only </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7'>attempts</run>
                    <run>/</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759'>carts</run>
                    <run> that were approved by Anti-Fraud + PSP/Bank Rules to be </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#edc948'>promoted to an order</run>
                    <run>, and only in these scenarios we should have an order status update associated with the scoring attempt, which come from the order-status topic. The amount of order-status updates we would expect varies across platforms due to the filters used by Anti-Fraud when consuming data-streams team information about orders.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='10714' id='29' is-fixed='true' name='Pay Updates per cart' w='43185' x='593' y='37608'>
                  <layout-cache cell-count-w='3' minheight='217' non-cell-size-w='52' type-h='scalable' type-w='cell' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
